  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool aggregation, weighted fusion) achieved 63.5% validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation, which may capture more complex interactions between modalities. Transformer aggregation is a key design choice with uncertain impact, and testing it with the same RNA/image encoders (pca_n2000/imagenet_vit_l) allows direct comparison. Expected cost is similar to config_001 (7.02 GPU hours), making it a cost-effective way to explore a critical design decision."
